# User stories and acceptance criteria

When the user requests any of the following, **read** `.cursor/skills/user-stories-formatting/SKILL.md` and apply its format and rules:

- Writing or generating user stories
- Breaking down an epic into user stories
- Reviewing, refining, or consolidating user stories
- Creating or formatting acceptance criteria
- Formatting content for Jira or Confluence (user story style)

Use the skill’s templates (title format, As a/I want/So that, AC format, pastable blocks) and project reference (actors, terminology, epic structure) when responding.
